@startuml UC1_PlayPauseMusic
title UC1: Play/Pause Music - Use Case Specification

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFCC
left to right direction
actor User
actor "S32K Board" as Board #LightCoral

rectangle "UC1: Play/Pause Music" {
    usecase "Play Music" as Play
    usecase "Pause Music" as Pause
    usecase "Resume Music" as Resume
}

User --> Play
User --> Pause
User --> Resume
Board --> Play
Board --> Pause

note right of Play
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Track đã được load (UC2)
  - Audio system initialized
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Music đang phát
  - PlayerState = PLAYING
  - UI hiển thị trạng thái Playing
  
  **Main Flow:**
  1. User click nút Play
  2. View gọi AppController.play()
  3. PlaybackController gọi AudioPlayer.play()
  4. AudioPlaybackImpl gọi Mix_ResumeMusic()
  5. PlayerState cập nhật PLAYING
  6. UI cập nhật icon Play → Pause
  
  **Alternative Flow:**
  A1. Chưa load track:
      - Hiển thị thông báo lỗi
      - Return về UI
end note

note right of Pause
  **Pre-conditions:**
  - Music đang phát (PLAYING)
  
  **Post-conditions:**
  - Music tạm dừng
  - PlayerState = PAUSED
  - Vị trí phát được giữ nguyên
  
  **Main Flow:**
  1. User click nút Pause
  2. View gọi AppController.pause()
  3. PlaybackController gọi AudioPlayer.pause()
  4. AudioPlaybackImpl gọi Mix_PauseMusic()
  5. PlayerState cập nhật PAUSED
  6. UI cập nhật icon Pause → Play
end note

@enduml
